translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_bab170b5:



    voice "2SA_0216"
    sachiko "「那正好。我来介绍下第三位室友。这位是绪方伦同学」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_48fdf700:



    voice "2HI_0523"
    hina "「初次见面，绪方同学。我是夏目阳菜，请多多关照」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_d6cad1f4:



    voice "2FU_0461"
    fumi "「我是浅生文。请多多关照」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_2a10bff5:



    voice "2RI_0545"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_3af5001a:


    "伦打了个叫人不知道她到底是打了没有的招呼。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_b3f3450a:



    voice "2SA_0217"
    sachiko "「嗯～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_c3bc5722:


    "祥子挠了挠鬓角。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_9d69d1c5:



    voice "2HI_0524"
    hina "「她是怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_b83152c3:



    voice "2SA_0218"
    sachiko "「哎，我还没和她说三人间的事儿……是有点闹别扭了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_886f01be:



    voice "2HI_0525"
    hina "「没有其他房间了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_21849542:



    voice "2SA_0219"
    sachiko "「嗯。今年哪间宿舍都没空了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_35469246:



    voice "2HI_0526"
    hina "「那就没办法了，绪方同学」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_f0f18c22:



    voice "2RI_0546"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_ec26360c:



    voice "2HI_0527"
    hina "「集体生活总是很辛苦呢。要多花点心思，还要去迎合别人」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_bc2990b6:



    voice "2HI_0528"
    hina "「希望我们的房间不会充满那样的气氛。有什么事都来商量吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_41982790:


    "说着阳菜伸出了手。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_3729753b:



    voice "2FU_0462"
    fumi "「嗯嗯。这也是一种缘分——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_da20f16a:


    "听到阳菜的话文也点了点头，伸出了手。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_fc8170a8:



    voice "2SA_0220"
    sachiko "「不是个好孩子吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_e76f3652:



    voice "2RI_0547RE"
    rin "「……我不喜欢集体生活」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_428f338c:


    "伦突然把脸扭到一边，与二人伸出的手擦身而过，进到了房间里。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_19b39f33:


    hina_fumi "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_e96b3d4e:


    "阳菜和文面面相觑。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_6a0e148f:



    voice "2RI_0548"
    rin "「啊！！！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_13e2312d:


    "伦因为羞耻而发出了惨叫。能理解她的心情。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_deeac992:



    voice "2HI_0530"
    hina "「我不喜欢集体生活」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_dbb02f24:



    voice "2RI_0549"
    rin "「啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_4ca20167:



    voice "2HI_0531"
    hina "「我不喜欢集体生活」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_ed41f4d7:


    "在文和圣夜子的笑声中，伦抱着脑袋在地上打滚。阳菜乘胜追击。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_3a46a5eb:



    voice "2RI_0550"
    rin "「杀了我吧杀了我吧！」"




translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_9dc90605:


    voice "2FU_0451"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_1e4fc8ed:


    fumi "「我也是。那个，夏目同学为什么会选择这个学校？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_29ba7408:


    voice "2FU_0453"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_07_39799d3e:


